# The dashboard "AI Models" page (Customize > AI Models) is being removed —
# the store's AI model names change too often for a synced-name management
# page to be worth the upkeep, and the {{AI_MODELS}} placeholder mechanism
# it powered (see 0057_aimodelname.py) goes with it. Legal protection for
